  "message_id": "MSG_022",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 05 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1D 01}我还是要叫学长！\n叫习惯了，而且学长就是学长嘛！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_010.bf.json:23:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_022",
